  "limits": "Floating-point predicates with a relative tolerance (1e-9 of the bounding-box diagonal): points closer than that to a face count as inside, and nearly coplanar faces may stay split. Fewer than four distinct points, or points that are all collinear or coplanar, raise an error. The command line output is flat shaded, so it is not closed as stored; the function result is closed.",
